Parrot (SpaceFleet)

This product includes software ported from the Apple Lossless Audio Codec (ALAC)
reference decoder (https://github.com/macosforge/alac):

  Copyright (c) 2011 Apple Inc. All rights reserved.
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see apple-alac-LICENSE.txt).

The port (packages/parrot-core/src/alac.ts and the Android decoder in
packages/mobile-audio-playback) translates Apple's C/C++ code to TypeScript and
Kotlin; the MP4 reading and the WAV output are Parrot's own.
